@startuml
title Operational Context — AIOS
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
actor "Sysadmin / SRE\nread-only viewer" as Admin
rectangle "AIOS\nAutonomous Linux performance optimizer" as AIOS
rectangle "Target workloads\nSelected Linux processes and cgroups" as Workloads
rectangle "Ubuntu 24.04 Linux host\nprocfs / PSI / cgroups v2" as Host
Admin --> AIOS : read-only dashboard status\nlocal HTTP GET
AIOS --> Workloads : read selected process state\nprocfs / cgroups v2
AIOS --> Host : request bounded resource controls\ncgroups v2
Workloads --> Host : run on Ubuntu Linux
@enduml
